{"4197500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pinball Chemist", "steam_appid": 4197500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As ALChemicalNet's newest chemist your job is to test probes in breaking pegs and getting around obstacles blocking interdimensional portals. While destroying pegs you will find geodes containing new elements; experiment in combining them into new solutions which give the probes special effects.  <br><br><br><br>Do your job as specified and you can work your way back home, but do keep up with payments as it was not cheap to build the lab and adjacent facilities. Remember, we are always watching and HR will be in contact through your terminal.<br><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, discovery, chemistry, alchemy, and casual arcade peg busting fun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 levels with a pinball/pachinko twist.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grind down geodes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4197500/extras/790457b8922faa241854790de44f50a5.poster.avif?t=1788092067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4197500/extras/790457b8922faa241854790de44f50a5.webm?t=1788092067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4197500/extras/790457b8922faa241854790de44f50a5.mp4?t=1788092067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2